# FICTIONAL model module, invented only to show the overlay shape. It stands in
# for the modules a real private overlay holds: keys that exist only in the
# controlled formats, declared here and never in the public core.
# It is marked `controlled` to show the mechanics; nothing in it is real.
module        xtdl
version       0.1.0
distribution  controlled
source        "invented for this example; no external document"
key  sector    int  -  "fictional: which of 32 sectors the reporter is in"
